!!! oculus/window-geometry-rectangle-ext.mat
!!! Rectangle extension: check if a rectangle is empty.

book oculus.window.geometry.rectangle-ext

read everything from ny.lang.core
read everything from oculus.window.geometry

rectangle begin extension
    is-empty returns boolean begin paragraph
        when my.width is at most 0 then
            give true
        otherwise when my.height is at most 0 then
            give true
        otherwise
            give false
        end when
    end paragraph
end extension
